-- and retraction propagates: refuting the warrant of any one report the quantity was computed from
-- refutes the quantity. Nothing is recomputed to know this and nothing is marked stale; the
-- dependency carries it. A field that publishes derived numbers without their dependencies cannot
-- state this proposition at all, which is why a correction there is a new release and not a
-- retraction, and why nobody can say which published results the correction overturns.
der-retracted : (I : Type 0) → (V : Type 0) → (d : Derived I V) → (i : I) → ((rep-warrant V (fst d i) → Empty) → Empty)
der-retracted I V d i = λ no → no (rep-witness V (fst d i))
